License index for this repository
=================================

This repository is an unofficial ROS 2 port of the ROS 1 package
`ar_track_alvar` (https://github.com/ros-perception/ar_track_alvar, branch
`noetic-devel`, commit a857aab4d6ac144478fb92f6624e0088473f4b33).

The upstream package is itself mixed-licensed, and the port keeps its
copyright notices and licenses. This file is an index of those licenses; it
does not relicense any file. Where a source file header states a license, that
header governs that file.

1. ALVAR library (LGPL-2.1)
   Paths:
     src/ar_track_alvar/src/
     src/ar_track_alvar/include/ar_track_alvar/
   Copyright (C) 2007-2012 VTT Technical Research Centre of Finland.
   The full license text is in LICENSES/LGPL-2.1.txt.

2. ROS node and helper code (BSD-3-Clause)
   Paths:
     src/ar_track_alvar/nodes/
     src/ar_track_alvar/include/ar_track_alvar/filter/
     src/ar_track_alvar/src/kinect_filtering.cpp
     src/ar_track_alvar/src/medianFilter.cpp
   Copyright (C) 2008 Willow Garage, Inc. and 2012 Scott Niekum.
   The BSD-3-Clause text is reproduced in the header of each of these files.

3. Messages (BSD)
   Path: src/ar_track_alvar_msgs/
   Distributed under the terms declared in its package.xml and file headers.

4. Assets and configuration
   Paths: src/ar_track_alvar/bundles/, src/ar_track_alvar/markers/,
          src/ar_track_alvar/launch/, src/ar_track_alvar/config/
   These files come from the upstream package and are distributed as part of
   it. See the upstream repository for their provenance.

The names of the original projects, organisations and authors are used only to
describe the origin of the code. This port is not affiliated with, sponsored
by, or endorsed by them.

The software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, as stated in
the applicable license texts.
